OL,4,T#######################################
OL,5,FSFO DECIDES AGAINST LEESON TRIAL IN UK
OL,6, The Serious Fraud Office says it will
OL,7, not seek to extradite former Barings
OL,8, trader Nick Leeson for trial in the UK.
OL,10,FMr Leeson, whose Singapore dealings led
OL,11,Fto the bank's collapse, is now likely
OL,12,Fto stand trial in Singapore, where he
OL,13,Ffaces up to 14 years in jail.
OL,15,FThe SFO said its recent interviews with
OL,16,FMr Leeson did "not substially add" to
OL,17,Fthe information they had already.
OL,18,F
OL,19,F"Having considered the matter, the SFO
OL,20,Fhas not altered its view that Singapore
OL,21,Fremains the principal jurisdiction for
OL,22,Fa criminal prosecution", it added.
OL,23,T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,GFrom 13-09-95
