OL,4,T#######################################
OL,5,FGRENADE ATTACK ON US EMBASSY IN MOSCOW
OL,6, The US embassy in Moscow has been hit
OL,7, by a rocket-propelled grenade, thought
OL,8, to have been fired from a car.
OL,10,FIt hit the sixth floor, shattering
OL,11,Fwindows, but did not enter the
OL,12,Fbuilding. There are no reports of
OL,13,Finjuries and staff have been evacuated.
OL,14,F
OL,15,FPolice found an abandoned grenade
OL,16,Flauncher and gloves at the scene.
OL,18,FThe reason for the attack is not known,
OL,19,Fbut US officials say there is no
OL,20,Fevidence to link it with Russian
OL,21,Fopposition to US-led NATO air strikes
OL,22,Fagainst Bosnian Serbs.
OL,23,T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,GFrom 13-09-95
