OL,4,T#######################################
OL,5,FTUC LEAVES MINIMUM WAGE FIGURE OPEN
OL,6, Delegates to the Trades Union Congress
OL,7, in Brighton have backed a measure
OL,8, calling for a national minimum wage.
OL,10,FThe vote was overwhelmingly in
OL,11,Ffavour, but they did not set a figure.
OL,12,F
OL,13,FMany unions had been pressing for a
OL,14,Ffigure of #4.15 an hour.
OL,15,F
OL,16,FAs the debate began a group of women
OL,17,Ftrade unionists interrupted
OL,18,Fproceedings.
OL,19,F
OL,20,FThey were demanding that the congress
OL,21,Finsisted on the #4.15 rate.
OL,23,T]FFromG13-09-95F  teletextarchive.com
