OL,4,T#######################################
OL,5,FNUCLEAR FIRM FACING SAFETY BREACH FINE
OL,6, A judge has warned Nuclear Electric to
OL,7, expect a "stinging" fine for breaking
OL,8, safety regulations at a power station.
OL,10,FThe firm is due to be sentenced at Mold
OL,11,FCrown Court, North Wales, tomorrow
OL,12,Fafter admitting four breaches of safety
OL,13,Frules at Wylfa, Anglesey, in 1993.
OL,14,F
OL,15,FIt took nine hours to shut down a
OL,16,Fnuclear reactor after an accident as
OL,17,Fplant officials put their "brains in
OL,18,Fneutral", the court heard.
OL,20,FBut Nuclear Electric fiercely denied
OL,21,Fprosecution claims that only luck
OL,22,Fprevented the plant from melting down.
OL,23,T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,GFrom 13-09-95
