OL,4,T#######################################
OL,5,FBORDER CLOSED AFTER 100 DIE IN SHOOTING
OL,6, Zaire has closed the border with Rwanda
OL,7, close to where clashes between Hutu
OL,8, rebels and Rwandan troops left over 100
OL,9, dead, including children and women.
OL,11,FA spokesman for the Tutsi-led Rwandan
OL,12,Fgovernment said the incident occurred
OL,13,Fwhen government troops investigated a
OL,14,Froadblock set up by Hutu militiamen.
OL,15,F
OL,16,FHe said fighting broke out when the
OL,17,FHutu militiamen opened fire. Villagers
OL,18,Fin the north-western town of Gisenyi
OL,19,Fwere killed in the crossfire.
OL,20,F
OL,21,FThe spokesman said Rwandan troops who
OL,22,Fused excessive force would be punished.
OL,23,T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,GFrom 13-09-95
